rsh realities of working on  hard problems which  is even the best approach can fail  that's exactly why  portfolio diversification is recommended  by finance  experts for the sa to hedge against  uncertainty  our kind of analysis what we're working  on has  implications for all fields because  remember humans are the problem solvers  power excellence on this planet  the young people i see are fantastic  they're much better than my generation  my generation was fine it was good but  this generation is much better  and it's really important because we  face really tough problems like climate  change  i am a complete optimist about human  beings yeah we're imperfect and  we're not as smart as we think we are  but we are really clever problem solvers  that's what humans do we just keep  improving and i don't see any limit to  [Music]  that

